From f0e8f2b3be77571148aa12b11e43042db7849179 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 07:01:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Keep mini-preview delete chrome stable during disintegration

The first delete frame was dropping the Delete tooltip, clipboard pill, and
opaque Save file control, while folder chips inherited the card dust
brightness filter and covered the live icon. Freeze hovered chrome, keep
clipboard above the blurred source, and start the folder breakup 50ms
earlier without a darkened plate.
